# SEO Audit Pro — optional keys. The tool runs 100% free with NONE of these.
#
# You normally DON'T need to edit this file: enter your keys once in the app's
# Options panel and they are saved here automatically (and reloaded on every
# launch). This file just documents the available keys, or lets you pre-seed
# them by copying it to ".env".

# ---- Optional: AI-written executive summary --------------------------------
# Paste ONE provider key; it is auto-detected from the prefix. Without any key
# the executive summary is written from a deterministic template instead.
# Groq is free at https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ---- Optional: PageSpeed Insights quota bump -------------------------------
# PageSpeed Insights v5 works with NO key. A free key (from a Google Cloud
# project) only raises the request quota. Leave blank to run keyless.
# PAGESPEED_API_KEY=
